{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26027","headline":"秋思三首 三 · 鲍溶","name":"秋思三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季秋天地闲，万物生意足。\n我忧长於生，安得及草木。\n试从古人愿，致酒歌秉烛。\n燕赵皆世人，讵能长似玉。\n俯怜老期近，仰视日车速。\n萧飒御风君，魂梦愿相逐。\n百年夜销半，端爲垂缨束。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}